title: A Housing Fund With a Coalition Price
subtitle: Delivery, a pilot, or another promise.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_government_card
view-if: left_in_government = 1 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and housing_minister_party = "Lewica" and month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_housing_fund_timer <= 0 and household_security < 85
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_housing_fund_timer = 5
card-image: img/poland/cards/housing-fund.webp

= Housing

The ministry has land, a draft and a coalition ceiling.

- @programme
- @pilot
- @guarantee

@programme
title: Launch the public housing programme
subtitle: Cost: 3 budget capacity.
choose-if: budget >= 3 and housing_minister_party = "Lewica"
unavailable-subtitle: Requires the Housing Ministry and three budget points.
on-arrival: budget -= 3; household_security += 8; government_delivery += 7; labor_credibility += 3; ko_coalition_dissent += 6; government_goal_housing = 1; news_headline = "The cabinet launches a public housing programme"

**Result:** [+ news_headline +].

- #poland_card_finish


@pilot
title: Fund a municipal pilot
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget capacity.
choose-if: budget >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Requires one budget point.
on-arrival: budget -= 1; household_security += 4; local_network += 2; government_delivery += 3; government_goal_housing = 1; news_headline = "Municipal housing pilots begin"

**Result:** [+ news_headline +].

- #poland_card_finish


@guarantee
title: Negotiate tenant guarantees first
subtitle: No spending; slower delivery.
on-arrival: household_security += 2; public_trust += 1; government_delivery += 1; government_goal_housing = 1; news_headline = "Tenant guarantees precede the housing fund"

**Result:** [+ news_headline +].

- #poland_card_finish
